<title>NETHERLANDS: KNP BT Q3 net from ordinary plunges.</title>
<headline>KNP BT Q3 net from ordinary plunges.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  38     vs  116</p>
<p>    Net per ord share (guilders)	   0.28  vs    1.06</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)			3.3   vs    3.7</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 111     vs  188</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts expected Dutch paper, office supplies and printing equipment group NV Koninklijke KNP BT to post a Q3 net from ordinary operations between 33 and 45 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops	  38     vs  116</p>
<p>    Financial charges			 42     vs   55</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
